HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The predecessor to mmoouunntt__mmssddooss utility named mmoouunntt__ppccffss appeared in
     NetBSD 0.8.  It was rewritten in NetBSD 1.0 and first appeared in
     FreeBSD 2.0.  mmoouunntt__mmssddooss was renamed to the more aptly-named
     mmoouunntt__mmssddoossffss in FreeBSD 5.0.  The character code conversion routine was
     added in 2003.

